  "evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-72c5d70fe8a4c2a3",
      "text": "In the αCD163/LNP-ZsGreen cohort, surface CD163 expression was markedly diminished, with minimal overlap between ZsGreen+ and CD163+ populations.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-24da017be1cd98f5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-31d1c91359b57ac9",
      "text": "In colocalization studies, LNP exhibited specific expression of ZsGreen protein in macrophages of fibrotic mice, with no detectable expression in other hepatic cell types",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-24da017be1cd98f5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "VLM-6649d72f82d06811",
      "text": "In panel L, the green bar for F4/80+ZsGreen is visibly taller than the green bar for Desmin+ZsGreen. | The caption states: 'K-L) IF images depicting the co-staining with markers for liver cells (ALB+), HSCs (Desmin+), macrophages (F4/80+)...' | In panel K, the merge image for DAPI/ZsGreen/F4/80 shows more ZsGreen signal overlapping with F4/80 compared to the Desmin channel.",
      "source_ids": [
        "GP-008-pnas.2534673123.sapp-p018-figure-01"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-197c0d55a09731fa",
      "text": "Conversely, unmodified LNP operates independently of CD163-mediated uptake, resulting in substantial ZsGreen/CD163 colocalization, thereby indirectly corroborating the targeting function of conjugated antibodies (SI Appendix, Fig.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-24da017be1cd98f5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-f945a79d5d56831e",
      "text": "In stark contrast, the αCD163/LNP-ZsGreen cohort displayed reduced CD163 positivity and a markedly diminished proportion of ZsGreen+/CD163+ double-positive macrophages (SI Appendix, Fig.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-24da017be1cd98f5"
      ]
    }
  ],
